Use Medicalholodeck AI to segment medical images and create patient-specific 3D anatomy. AI segmentation requires a connected PC (PC VR).\n\nTEACH AND COLLABORATE\nExplore the same medical content together across locations. Use RecordXR to record and replay spatial sessions for teaching and review.\n\nFOR STUDENTS AND EDUCATORS\nDesigned for anatomy education, medical training, research and case discussions. Free student access is available with proof of enrollment: info@medicalholodeck.com.\n\nMedicalholodeck is intended for education, communication, training and research. It is not a certified medical device.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "Step inside medical imaging and human anatomy. Medicalholodeck brings scans, anatomical models and real human dissections into an interactive 3D space for learning, teaching and collaboration.\n\nEXPLORE MEDICAL IMAGING IN 3D\nTurn CT, MRI and other DICOM datasets into interactive 3D volumes. Examine anatomy from different perspectives and explore spatial relationships beyond flat images.\n\nLEARN ANATOMY IN VR\nStudy more than 2,000 anatomical structures with Anatomy Master. Explore real human dissections with Dissection Master and build your understanding of how structures fit together.\n\nCREATE 3D ANATOMY WITH AI\nUse Medicalholodeck AI to segment medical images and create patient-specific 3D anatomy. AI segmentation requires a connected PC (PC VR).\n\nTEACH AND COLLABORATE\nExplore the same medical content together across locations. Use RecordXR to record and replay spatial sessions for teaching and review.\n\nFOR STUDENTS AND EDUCATORS\nDesigned for anatomy education, medical training, research and case discussions. Free student access is available with proof of enrollment: info@medicalholodeck.com.\n\nMedicalholodeck is intended for education, communication, training and research. It is not a certified medical device.", "genre_names": ["Learning", "Medical"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "3916133298437928", 